<title>JAPAN: Ohmura Shigyo - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Ohmura Shigyo - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  2.18</p>
<p> Operating	  102    million</p>
<p> Current	     94    million</p>
<p> Net		   46    million</p>
<p> EPS		    9.48 yen</p>
<p> Shares		5 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Ohmura Shigyo Co Ltd is a manufacturer of cardboard cases and sheets. No comparable figures for the previus term were available due to change in accounting term.</p>
</text>
